OL,3,GNEWSAChannel Islands welcome UK-EU deal
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe Channels Islands are set to benefit
OL,6,Ffrom a new deal for a closer working
OL,7,Frelationship between the UK and
OL,8,FEuropean Union (EU), the islands'
OL,9,Fgovernments have said.
OL,11,FOn Friday the UK and EU agreed a new
OL,12,Fdeal covering food exports, youth
OL,13,Fmobility and carbon emissions.
OL,15,FBoth Jersey's and Guernsey's
OL,16,Fgovernments said the new package would
OL,17,Fmake trade easier since from March
OL,18,F2028. Most checks on food, fish and
OL,19,Fagricultural goods moving between the
OL,20,FUK, EU and Crown Dependencies are set
OL,21,Fto end.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
